{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06729","headline":"长歌行 · 王昌龄","name":"长歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旷野饶悲风，飕飕黄蒿草。\n系马倚白杨，谁知我怀抱。\n所是同袍者，相逢尽衰老。\n北登汉家陵，南望长安道。\n下有枯树根，上有鼯鼠窠。\n高皇子孙尽，千载无人过。\n宝玉频发掘，精灵其奈何？\n人生须达命，有酒且长歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}